{title: HOMEWARD BOUND}
{subtitle: Simon and Garfunkel}
(1) Pick/pluck the open 2nd and 3rd strings together.  (2) Form (F) and pick those same strings.   (3) Lift off and again pick the same 2nd and 3rd strings.
(4) Back down with an (F) but this time move your picking hand up one string-set and pick the 3rd and 4th strings together.  (5) Now form (C) and pick those same 3rd and 4th strings together.  (6) Keeping the (C) move up a string-set and pick the 4th and 5th strings together.  (7) Still holding (C) drop down a string-set and pick the 3rd and 4th strings together.  (8) Now form (G) and pick the top and 4th strings together.  Nice, eh?  And not too hard.

